This license covers the code written for this project (web/mac/, web/tests/,
macos/ and the documentation). The calculator engine comes from
https://github.com/malufloyd/hp12c, which declares no license; it is NOT part
of this repository and NOT covered by this license. web/fetch-upstream.sh
downloads it into web/upstream/ at a pinned commit and applies
web/upstream.patch; see web/UPSTREAM.md. The decimal.js bundled with it is
distributed under its own MIT license.

